WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-09 - Pressure & Lies
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:15.500
[Instrumental Intro]

00:01:16.007 --> 00:01:20.500
Midnight in a plastic chair

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:24.800
Breathing in the stale, dead air

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:29.500
A broken cracker, lukewarm drink

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:34.614
No time to rest, no time to think

00:01:34.674 --> 00:01:39.000
The driver's waiting, knows my name

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:43.200
A single piece left in the game

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:47.837
I feel the ache, a steady thrum

00:01:48.498 --> 00:01:51.280
To what new hell have I become?

00:01:54.668 --> 00:01:59.500
There's a fire burning on my skin

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:04.200
A secret war I'll never win

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:09.100
I try to show her where it hurts

00:02:09.252 --> 00:02:14.200
She answers back with silent smirks

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:18.500
A roll of eyes, a heavy sigh

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:23.376
Just another pressure, another lie

00:02:32.985 --> 00:02:37.200
She doesn't see, she doesn't care

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:41.800
Just leaves me sitting, sitting there

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:46.200
The clock is ticking on the wall

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:51.669
Before the final curtain call

00:02:51.749 --> 00:02:56.200
I planned the stops, I made the calls

00:02:56.300 --> 00:03:00.800
To get past stations, halls, and walls

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:05.200
A world prepared to help me through

00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:09.500
But what good does it do with you?

